<title>UK: PSK adds 100 billion lire to December 2006 bond.</title>
<headline>PSK adds 100 billion lire to December 2006 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 100 billion lire bond is fungible with an outstanding 400 billion lire bond, launched on November 13, 1996, joint lead managers Cariplo and Bear Stearns said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OESTERREICHISCHE POSTSPARKASSE</p>
<p> AMT   *100 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.50	MATURITY    11.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.7     PAY DATE    29.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   +138 DAYS ACCRUED</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
